# contract-acceptance-v1 PASSING fixture: Prospect B mutual NDA (new process, R9)
# and Prospect B self-serve use on the public terms (R10).
# NDA: HubSpot form with the versioned English mutual NDA and a required consent
# field (consent recorded) -> Kotoba Labs signatory confirmed authority and
# explicitly accepted -> in force; executed version stored.
# Must conform to BOTH ontology/workspace-ops-v1.mith and
# ontology/contract-acceptance-v1.mith (mithril reason, exit 0).
# Anonymised: no person names, e-mail, phone, form ids or document ids.
<urn:ca-b:ws> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://mithril.fund/ns/workspace-ops/v1#Workspace> .
